      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The walk-in fridge is locked, and suddenly nobody in the kitchen has ever seen the spare key. Barinov blames his staff and spreads his hands. The inspector is sorry to hear it, but he has come prepared. Listen for the moment he reaches into his pocket.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
